# eFootball Arena Backend - Development

## Quick Start

```bash
cd backend
npm install
cp .env.example .env
npm run dev
```

## API Endpoints

### Authentication
- POST /api/auth/register
- POST /api/auth/login
- POST /api/auth/logout
- POST /api/auth/refresh
- GET /api/auth/verify

### Players
- GET /api/players
- GET /api/players/:id
- GET /api/players/:id/stats
- GET /api/players/search/:username
- POST /api/players
- PUT /api/players/:id
- POST /api/players/:id/verify-konami
- GET /api/players/:id/history

### Tournaments
- GET /api/tournaments
- GET /api/tournaments/:id
- GET /api/tournaments/:id/bracket
- GET /api/tournaments/:id/participants
- POST /api/tournaments (admin)
- PUT /api/tournaments/:id (admin)
- POST /api/tournaments/:id/join
- POST /api/tournaments/:id/leave
- POST /api/tournaments/:id/start (admin)
- POST /api/tournaments/:id/generate-matches (admin)

### Matches
- GET /api/matches
- GET /api/matches/:id
- GET /api/matches/:id/live
- POST /api/matches/:id/start
- POST /api/matches/:id/score
- POST /api/matches/:id/approve (admin)
- POST /api/matches/:id/dispute
- GET /api/matches/:id/replay

### Rankings
- GET /api/rankings
- GET /api/rankings/seasonal
- GET /api/rankings/monthly
- GET /api/rankings/:id
- GET /api/rankings/:id/history

### Chat
- GET /api/chat/rooms/:roomId
- POST /api/chat/send
- DELETE /api/chat/:messageId
- POST /api/chat/rooms/:roomId/mute/:playerId

### Admin
- GET /api/admin/stats
- GET /api/admin/stats/players
- GET /api/admin/stats/tournaments
- GET /api/admin/players
- POST /api/admin/players/:id/verify
- POST /api/admin/players/:id/ban
- POST /api/admin/players/:id/unban
- DELETE /api/admin/players/:id
- GET /api/admin/reports
- POST /api/admin/reports/:id/resolve
- POST /api/admin/reports/:id/dismiss
- GET /api/admin/tournaments
- POST /api/admin/tournaments/:id/cancel
- POST /api/admin/moderate/message/:id
- POST /api/admin/moderate/warning/:playerId

## WebSocket Events

### Match Events
- match:join
- match:update-score
- match:end
- match:player-joined (receive)
- match:score-updated (receive)
- match:status-changed (receive)

### Chat Events
- chat:join-room
- chat:message
- chat:leave-room
- chat:user-joined (receive)
- chat:new-message (receive)
- chat:user-left (receive)

### Tournament Events
- tournament:subscribe
- tournament:bracket-update
- tournament:bracket-updated (receive)

### Notification Events
- notification:subscribe

## Testing

```bash
npm test
```

## Linting

```bash
npm run lint
```
